0..60 Comment "//! This source defines state-passing models of `State.Eff`."
61..64 Comment "//!"
65..136 Comment "//! `get` gives the current state to its continuation. The carrier is a"
137..171 Comment "//! function from state to result."
172..242 Comment "//! In the standard model of a second-order signature, the binder of a"
243..284 Comment "//! representable sort is an exponential."
285..288 Comment "//!"
289..353 Comment "//! The checker derives model operations from the stated theory."
354..357 Comment "//!"
358..433 Comment "//! Limits: a law that relates terms at the port of `get` is a path between"
434..499 Comment "//! host functions. The derivation does not state such a law yet."
500..503 Comment "//!"
504..580 Comment "//! - see: `../../pathological/effects/state-model.gandr` — model refusals"
581..611 Comment "//! - see: #2421 — `carried`"
612..667 Comment "//! - cites: [Fiore-2010-second_order_equational_logic]"
668..671 Comment "//!"
672..811 Comment "//! [Fiore-2010-second_order_equational_logic]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-15205-4_26 \"Fiore and Hur, Second-Order Equational Logic\""
